/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document specifies a return routability check for use in context\n   of the Connection ID (CID) construct for the Datagram Transport Layer\n   Security (DTLS) protocol versions 1.2 and 1.3.\n\nDiscussion Venues\n\n   This note is to be removed before publishing as an RFC.\n\n   Discussion of this document takes place on the Transport Layer\n   Security Working Group mailing list (tls@ietf.org), which is archived\n   at https://mailarchive.ietf.org/arch/browse/tls/.\n\n   Source for this draft and an issue tracker can be found at\n   https://github.com/tlswg/dtls-rrc.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-dtls-rrc/", "expires": "2026-01-08T11:26:08Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 395687, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-dtls-rrc", "note": "", "notify": "sean@sn3rd.com", "pages": 23, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/395687/", "rev": "19", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/sean@sn3rd.com/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/154/", "/api/v1/doc/state/112/", "/api/v1/doc/state/12/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-07-07T23:26:17Z", "title": "Return Routability Check for DTLS 1.2 and DTLS 1.3", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document specifies a return routability check for use in context\n   of the Connection ID (CID) construct for the Datagram Transport Layer\n   Security (DTLS) protocol versions 1.2 and 1.3.\n\nDiscussion Venues\n\n   This note is to be removed before publishing as an RFC.\n\n   Discussion of this document takes place on the Transport Layer\n   Security Working Group mailing list (tls@ietf.org), which is archived\n   at https://maila